  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fresh from harvest: fruit based confectionary and desserts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The applicant Blue Skies Holdings Ltd (BSH), started in 1998, sources, processes and delivers fresh cuts fruits to Europe. The local partner is Blue Skies Juice (Ghana) Ltd (BSJ), which is a full daughter company of Blue Skies Holdings. The company was initially set up in 2010 to produce pineapple juice for export. Currently, they are producing fresh juice for the local market which proved to be highly successful.BSH and BSJ have developed the production of coconut and fruit based confectionary and deserts from locally sourced natural ingredients. Initially the focus of this project is on the Ghanaian market, followed by the regional market (Nigeria) and the EU market in the future.</narrative>
  </description>
